    <string name="settings_threat_model">What Antumbra protects</string>
    <string name="threat_protects">Hides your IP address from sites, DNS lookups from your network, and keeps every site on its own circuit. Blocks WebRTC, location, sensors, downloads and links that would leave Tor. Bridges hide Tor itself from your network.</string>
    <string name="threat_limits">Antumbra does not look identical to Tor Browser, so a site can tell it apart. It cannot protect you if you log in to your accounts or share personal details, and no tool defeats an adversary that watches the whole network. For high-risk use, prefer Tor Browser or Tails.</string>
